; Models: a downlifter, noise and a sine falling from 2 kHz to 60 Hz over two seconds | Neglects: a reverb | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: fx
crop(0.95*tanh(1.4*(0.7*sin(2*pi*2000*(1 - exp(-1.75*t))/1.75)*exp(-t/0.9) + 0.6*bandpass(sample(rand(t, seed=121)), cutoff=60 + 3000*exp(-1.9*t), q=2)*exp(-t/1.1))), 0s, 2.2s, rise=0.003s, fall=0.6s)
